WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.064 --> 00:00:03.648
Cupcake was on Bok Choy.

2
00:00:03.649 --> 00:00:06.839
Her icing made a big mess!

3
00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:10.738
"I'm sorry," Cupcake said.

4
00:00:10.739 --> 00:00:17.578
Bok Choy sighed.

5
00:00:17.579 --> 00:00:22.716
Bok Choy took a shower.

6
00:00:22.717 --> 00:00:27.992
Soon he was clean.

7
00:00:27.993 --> 00:00:40.820
The kitchen was not.

8
00:00:40.821 --> 00:00:53.048
Cupcake and Berry kept playing.

9
00:00:53.049 --> 00:00:57.244
"Time to clean up," Bok Choy said.

10
00:00:57.245 --> 00:01:09.706
Cupcake laughed. "That's not fun!"

11
00:01:09.707 --> 00:01:21.282
Bok Choy got a mop.

12
00:01:21.283 --> 00:01:26.845
"Let's ask Bok Choy to play," Cupcake said.

13
00:01:26.846 --> 00:01:29.851
"He's cleaning," Berry said.

14
00:01:29.852 --> 00:01:39.043
"Huh?" Cupcake looked.

15
00:01:39.044 --> 00:01:43.219
Bok Choy was working hard.

16
00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:46.179
Cupcake went over to him.

17
00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:51.447
"That doesn't look fun."

18
00:01:51.448 --> 00:01:55.566
"It's not fun," Bok Choy said.

19
00:01:55.567 --> 00:02:02.214
"But it must be done."

20
00:02:02.215 --> 00:02:07.569
Cupcake felt bad.

21
00:02:07.570 --> 00:02:10.769
"We'll help," she said.

22
00:02:10.770 --> 00:02:15.987
"Then it's fun time."

23
00:02:15.988 --> 00:02:21.267
The three friends cleaned.

24
00:02:21.268 --> 00:02:26.359
Soon the kitchen sparkled.

25
00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:31.630
"Is it fun time now?" Cupcake asked.

26
00:02:31.631 --> 00:02:35.790
"Yes." Bok Choy nodded.

27
00:02:35.791 --> 00:02:39.098
Bok Choy started reading.

28
00:02:39.099 --> 00:02:43.964
Cupcake and Berry danced.

29
00:02:43.965 --> 00:02:52.914
Bok Choy tapped his foot—just a little bit.

